      "content": "GENERAL information",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d2ed7145-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "This agreement is subject to revision without prior notice. Please check with a counselor every semester to obtain current information about possible changes in the agreement. To learn more about the courses and programs offered at Sonoma State University or the General Education and Upper-division requirements for each major please refer to the university catalog at: http://www.sonoma.edu/catalog/",
      "contentHtml": "This agreement is subject to revision without prior notice.  Please check with a counselor every semester to obtain current information about possible changes in the agreement.  To learn more about the courses and programs offered at Sonoma State University or the General Education and Upper-division requirements for each major please refer to the university catalog at: <a href=\"http://www.sonoma.edu/catalog/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.sonoma.edu/catalog/</a>"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec9c3fd5-2a78-4e57-845d-019832dc4a3c",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "Important Information Regarding this Major",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dfa1e606-bce4-4663-bfdd-019832da5715",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "Please be advised that this major is currently being discontinued and may not be available upon transfer. Please visit academicaffairs.sonoma.edu/academic-programs for the most recent information.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(169, 62, 58); font-size: 16px;\">Please be advised that this major is currently being discontinued and may not be available upon transfer. Please visit</strong><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </strong><a href=\"http://academicaffairs.sonoma.edu/academic-programs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>academicaffairs.sonoma.edu/academic-programs</strong></a><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(169, 62, 58); font-size: 16px;\">for the most recent information.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "52ec7145-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 4,
      "content": "Important Transfer Information",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b2fe7645-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 5,
      "content": "MATHEMATICS AND STATISTICS MAJORS AND MINORS: A mathematics and statistics major or minor must take all mathematics and statistics courses in the traditional grading mode, with the exceptions of courses offered only in CR/NC modes and any course taken as credit by challenge examination.",
      "contentHtml": "MATHEMATICS AND STATISTICS MAJORS AND MINORS:  A mathematics and statistics major or minor must take all mathematics and statistics courses in the traditional grading mode, with the exceptions of courses offered only in CR/NC modes and any course taken as credit by challenge examination.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4ff6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 6,
      "content": "Associate degree for transfer information",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0d007045-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 7,
      "content": "The AS-T in Mathematics (SB 1440 degree) has been deemed as &quot;similar&quot; degree to the Applied Statistics, B.A. at Sonoma State. Students transfering to SSU with an AS-T in Mathematics are advised to complete all available articulated major requirement and support courses before transfer. It is also recommended that students complete the American Instutitions (US-1, US-2, US-3), and Seawolf Studies Graduation requirements before transfer.",
      "contentHtml": "The AS-T in Mathematics (SB 1440 degree) has been deemed as &quot;similar&quot; degree to the Applied Statistics, B.A. at Sonoma State.  Students transfering to SSU with an AS-T in Mathematics are advised to complete all available articulated major requirement and support courses before transfer. It is also recommended that students complete the American Instutitions (US-1, US-2, US-3), and Seawolf Studies Graduation requirements before transfer."
    }
